		{"id":"asset-stage2-card","type":"text","text":"## Choose the cheapest useful start\n**Hero:** custom model.  **Props:** pilot Meshy.  **NPC volume:** consider Reallusion only if its look fits the game.","x":-190,"y":-335,"width":820,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"asset-stage5-result","type":"text","text":"# READY\nShip only after validation in the real game scene—not just a modeling preview.","x":230,"y":500,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"3"},
