		{"id":"asset-stage4-card","type":"text","text":"## Match the rig to the asset\n**Main characters:** Blender Rigify.  **Fast prototypes:** AccuRIG.  **Mocap:** pilot Rokoko only when animation volume justifies it.","x":-270,"y":205,"width":900,"height":150,"color":"4"},
